        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The Clingy Ghost&quot; is a short horror-comedy game where you play as an exorcist on a mission to blast away a haunted house’s curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>【 Please Deal With the Evil Spirits 】</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474310/extras/fd670108b4c12e08044e234b87e76454.avif?t=1762802704\" width=1560 height=728 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you need to do is carry a curse-busting item to the shrine inside the haunted house—easy, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well… it’s so cursed that it’s basically an Evil Spirit Paradise. But I’m sure you can handle it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>【 Your Ghost Buddy is Always With You! 】</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474310/extras/56c7d3f3f0a998da10bc24d6b257d85c.avif?t=1762802704\" width=1560 height=680 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mischievous ghost sidekick, Ryuji, has a sixth sense for curses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen carefully to his pointless rambling—there just might be a clue to survival hidden in there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Voice Cast:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keisuke Akai as Takumi</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Setsugekka as Ryuji</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mikaze Nekoyashiki as Evil Spirits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Playtime:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approx. 30 minutes (Feels like watching a single anime episode)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Number of Endings:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How Did It Come to This:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474310/extras/6e5283e7b6d7318db413a093cee67a58.avif?t=1762802704\" width=1560 height=676 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even star exorcists have bills to pay. I swore I’d take any job this time...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >…but nobody said anything about a cursed haunted house, Ryuji!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move: WASD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash: Left Shift</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View: Mouse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Menu: ESC</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact: E</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack (Specific Scenes): Left Click</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[ Disclaimer ]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※This game includes frequent jump scares and shonen manga–level crude jokes and language. We are not responsible for any physical, mental, or spiritual damage that may occur while playing. Play at your own risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[ Streaming Guidelines ]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming, video uploads, and monetization of &quot;The Clingy Ghost&quot; are fully allowed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No prior permission is required — knock yourself out!</p>",
